  (descr "Alps Alpine RKJXV122400R through-hole analog joystick with center push. Mounting-side land pattern transcribed from official RKJXV Series Drawing No. 1, catalog update 2510: https://tech.alpsalpine.com/cms.media/product_catalog_mu_01_rkjxv_en_05974b8a16.pdf. Logical pad mapping: 1=VCC (both VR terminal 3), 2=GND (both VR terminal 1 and switch left pair a/b), 3=VR1 wiper/X, 4=VR2 wiper/Y, 5=switch right pair c/d. Four unnumbered plated holes are mandatory soldered metal lugs; two 1.6 mm holes are NPTH locating bosses.")
